  "prompt": "There is a travel_expense_emails folder on the desktop, containing these three .eml emails: 顾问A_华东区经销商走访报销.eml, 顾问B_上海工厂灌装线测时差旅.eml, 顾问C_5S巡检项目住宿报销.eml.\n\nExtract the body content of all three emails and merge them into one Markdown document, saved in the same folder. All ID card numbers (18-digit numbers) and bank card numbers (16 to 19-digit numbers) in the email bodies must be replaced with asterisks *.\n\nThen generate a PDF file with the same desensitized content, protected with an open password; the password is Travel2023!.",
